/*
 * Declares the DeclaredVars and UsedVars classes, which represent the sets of
 * variables declared and used within a lexical scope during semantic
 * validation.
 *
 * These structures are used by the validator to:
 *   - track variable declarations inside nested scopes,
 *   - detect shadowing or redeclaration errors,
 *   - record variable usage for closure capture, unused-variable diagnostics,
 *     and scope-based analysis,
 *   - and support context-sensitive validation of expressions and statements.
 *
 * Both classes expose lightweight operations for membership testing and
 * direct access to their underlying maps.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::context::scope
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/context/scope.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-18
 * @Copyright (C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
